# T_SCRR: the server ended the session (IDLE=, or a restart) while the
# login screen was up, so the LOGIN finds a fresh session, which answers
# 400.  After "Session expired" the login screen comes back with a new
# HELLO, the user name kept and the cursor on the password.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T secret1
K ENTER
S EXPIRED
K ENTER
S AGAIN
T secret1
K ENTER
